        {
          "text": "Lufu walumenenena mane kukabe kutamani. Mwami Jehova uyoosindula misozi kumasyu oonse, akwalo kusampaulwa kwabantu bakwe uyookumanisya, nkaambo mbubeobo Jehova mbwaamba.",
