        {
          "text": "Lino mubuzuba obo kuyooambwa kuti, Amubone! Ngooyu Leza wesu, Twali kumulindila kuti atufutule, Ngooyu Jehova. Twali kumulindila. Atukondwe akusekelela mulufutuko lwakwe. ",
