        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ijanza lya-Jehova liyoolazikwa acilundu ecino, elyo cisi ca-Moabu ciyoolyataulwa mbubonya mbuli bwizu mbubulyataulwa mukati kamaanzi aacitantala. ",
