          "text": "Elyo uyootandabika maanza aakwe mukati kaco mbubonya mbuli sikuyamba mbwatandabika maanza aakwe mukuyamba, nkabela uyoofwiinsya kulikankaizya kwakwe alweeno lwamaanza aakwe. ",
